<title>POLAND: Merrill to guarantee BIG GDR issue.</title>
<headline>Merrill to guarantee BIG GDR issue.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>A consortioum led by Merrill Lynch International will on July 28 sign a deal with Bank Inicjatyw Gospodarczych SA (BIG) to guarantee the Polish bank's GDR issue, BIG said in a statement on Wednesday.</p>
<p>BIG plans to issue 75 million shares to serve as a base for its GDR issue. It earlier set the issue price at 3.3 to 5.3 zlotys per share.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
